6) Orders topiğini oluşturmak için orders-topic.yaml oluştur

apiVersion: kafka.strimzi.io/v1beta2
kind: KafkaTopic
metadata:
  name: orders
  namespace: kafka
  labels:
    strimzi.io/cluster: my-kafka
spec:
  partitions: 6
  replicas: 3
  config:
    retention.ms: 86400000

7) Kullanıcı (SCRAM) örneği (app1-user.yaml)
apiVersion: kafka.strimzi.io/v1beta2
kind: KafkaUser
metadata:
  name: app1
  namespace: kafka
  labels:
    strimzi.io/cluster: my-kafka
spec:
  authentication:
    type: scram-sha-512
  authorization:
    type: simple
    acls:
      - resource: { type: topic, name: orders, patternType: literal }
        operation: Read
      - resource: { type: group, name: app1-group, patternType: literal }
        operation: Read
      - resource: { type: topic, name: orders, patternType: literal }
        operation: Write


